  "Structure it as one stack per deployable piece, with the environment (`dev` / `prod`) as a stack prop rather than a copied file. Put every tunable \u2014 instance sizes, retention, memory, the domain \u2014 in one `config.ts` with the dev defaults set to the cheapest thing that works.",
